(populate_ui_button
 (description Add a button that populates the UI with the commented data in `src/view/DayView.vue`.)
 (steps
  (1 Add a button to `src/view/DayView.vue`.)
  (2 Add a click handler to the button.)
  (3 In the click handler, use the commented data to initialize the activity store.)
 )
